abstract: >-
  Paired simulation benchmark (500 salt cavities x 3 observation-coverage tiers =
  1500 paired point cloud samples) with four composable sonar missingness
  mechanisms, an evaluation protocol separating geometric error from volume
  error (dual reference volumes, integrable-slice counting, three-way common
  support, input-matched no-completion baselines), and stability checks along
  initialization, data-order, and integration-configuration dimensions.
